  "description": "Han has always had trouble relating to women, but when he plays a new game called World of Hartz he finds himself involved in a totally immersive gaming experience that turns him into an online hero and an instant hit with all the virtual ladies. His growing reputation as the best Hartz player leads to a job offer from the game developer. Once inside, Han finds out that there is a lot more going on than fun, games, and chasing girls. A web of power, politics, and international conspiracies plus a game so addictive that it destroys lives add up to the ultimate challenge for Han as he fights to save his friends and his world.\nSource: Tokyopop",
